   "lines": [
    "West, Emlen, Will T., &",
    "one guide (Sewell), &",
    "Fox[?] in a batteau",
    "started down stream to",
    "a large lake ^(Mattawamkeag[?])^ at whose",
    "foot we are camping",
    "out; I preceeded them",
    "in a canoe with",
    "another guide (Dow)",
    "& had good fun pad-",
    "-dling, and tramp-",
    "-ing through the",
    "woods, but though",
    "I had several shots",
    "at pigeons & ducks",
    "I missed them all."
   ],
